"1. Is there any way to stop those water demons from popping out of the
fountains?"

I suggest waiting until you are strong enough to defeat water demons before 
using fountains. If your luck is good, there is less chance of them appearing.
If you are unable to quickly kill demons, they may replicate when you are hitting
them. 

"2. What is there to do at an altar?"

You may offer dead monsters at alters, which increases your luck with your god. 
You do this by using the # sign followed by the letter o, after laying the dead
creature on the alter. If the alter is one of other than your alignment, your
successful offer will convert the alter to that of your god. Beware of converting
lawful alters as you may want to save these to make holy water with! 


